    print("<div class=\"doc-detail-layout\"><main class=\"content doc-page doc-detail\"><div class=\"doc-title\"><h2>is_nan</h2><span class=\"call-boundary lib-call\">lib call</span></div><div class=\"doc-section signatures\"><h3>Capy</h3><pre>function is_nan(value : f32) bool\nfunction is_nan(value : f64) bool</pre></div><div class=\"doc-section content\"><h3>Description</h3><p><code>is_nan()</code> tests if <code>value</code> is NaN.</p><p>The compiler emits a direct lib call.</p></div><div class=\"doc-section params\"><h3>Parameters</h3><div><p>value : the floating-point value</p></div><div></div></div><div class=\"doc-section\"><h3>Return Values</h3><p><code>true</code> or <code>false</code>.</p></div><div class=\"doc-section example\"><h3>Example</h3><div class=\"example-language capy\"><h4>Capy</h4><pre class=\"example-source\">print(is_nan(0.0), &quot;\\n&quot;)\n</pre></div></div></main><aside class=\"doc-section see-also\"><h3>See also</h3><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/sqrt/\">sqrt</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/abs/\">abs</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/neg/\">neg</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/floor/\">floor</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/ceil/\">ceil</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/trunc/\">trunc</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/nearest/\">nearest</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/min/\">min</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/max/\">max</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/copysign/\">copysign</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/pow/\">pow</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/log/\">log</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/exp/\">exp</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/sin/\">sin</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/cos/\">cos</a><a class=\"related-link\" href=\"/doc/api/atan2/\">atan2</a><a class=")
